  <p class="gd-lede">Heli-skiing is a team activity in a serious environment, and how you behave in the group shapes the day for everyone, including you. Good etiquette is mostly common sense plus a bit of mountain awareness, but knowing it in advance makes you a smoother, safer and more welcome member of the group. This is how to be the person everyone wants on the trip, before you look at <a href="/packages">the packages</a>.</p>
